# Active Context — SoundMemory

## Current Status
Feature-complete and accurate as of 2026-09-24. Three sound banks (alert, impact, birds); hidden bank selector via lower-right tile triple-tap.

## What's Working
- Full game loop: shuffle → click → match/mismatch → "Done!"
- Offline PWA (SW precache of all assets + 42 mp3s, skipWaiting/clientsClaim)
- Full-screen rectangular tile layout with 5% margins and pale rainbow colors, responsive on window resize (`windowResized()` → `resizeCanvas` + `redraw`, layout derived per-`draw()` from `width`/`height`)
- Three sound banks: `sounds_alert/` (system tones), `sounds_impact/` (Kenney CC0), `sounds_birds/` (mixkit)
- Hidden bank selector: triple-tap (3 taps within 600 ms) on the lower-right tile before any other play; dropdown offers Alert / Impact / Bird; tile clicks ignored while dropdown open
- Score counter `B:bids M:matches` at the lower-right tile position
- 500 ms match celebration (mid-rainbow flash) and 500 ms mismatch re-hide

## Recent Changes
- Renamed `sounds/` → `sounds_alert/`; added `sounds_impact/` (Kenney, CC0, credited in README) and `sounds_birds/` (mixkit, credited in README)
- Bank selection originally planned as a start dropdown; redesigned per user preference to a hidden triple-tap gesture (game starts immediately on Alert)
- Added `SOUND_BANKS` map, `loadBank()`, `showBankSelect()`, `tapTimes`/`secretArmed` state, `bankSelect` guard
- `sw.js` cache list now covers all 42 MP3s (cache name `soundmemory-cache-v0`)
- README + memory-bank updated to document the birds bank and hidden gesture

